# Shared component specs

Path: `.cursor/specs/shared/shared-components.spec.md` — one file, one `## ComponentName` section per component.

## Required subsections per component

Purpose, Location, Files, Props, Tech stack, UI, Behavior, Accessibility, Storybook, Tests, Usage.

## Overview table

Keep the component index table at the top in sync when adding components.

## Rules

- New component → add section + row in Overview table.
- Usage lists consumer paths only; do not duplicate page logic.
- Link from page specs via `../shared/shared-components.spec.md#anchor`.
